  "description": "Eagle 12\"14\"16\"20\" Kids Bike\n\nHi-ten Frame with Cool Design – Lightweight, rugged and eye-catching.\nErgonomic Seat & Wide Tires - Provides a more comfortable cycling experience.\n\nTwo Separate Brake Systems – Fully ensure the riding safety.\nSingle Speed Drivetrain- Easy for children to control.\n\nDurable and Comfortable\n\nHiland hi-ten steel frame is lightweight and durable. Impressive colors and the simple design bring a sporty aesthetic to this bike.\n\nPlus, the ergonomic and adjustable seat make this the most comfortable bike for kids to ride around the neighborhood.\n\nReliable Brake\n\nEquipped with two separate brake systems to fully ensure your child's safety. V-brake is lighter and easier to maintain and adjust. Rear coaster brake provides dependable control as needed, and simply pedals backwards to stop.\n\nFront and rear steel linear pull handbrakes with kid-sized levers are easy to pull and provide consistent and reliable stopping action on demand, allowing kids to stop quickly in case of an emergency. The chain cover and the protective devices on the edge of the handlebars protect the child.\n\nEasy Handling\n\nThe single-speed design is better suited for beginners. The simple setup gives kids confidence and helps them maintain control. It is the perfect transition model for training wheels.\n\nWide 1.95\" pneumatic tires add more stability, and trailing edge tires provide good traction in wet and dry conditions.\n\nAssembly & Size Guide\n\n90% pre-assembled, assembly tools included, easy to assemble within 20 minutes.\n\nThe 12-inch bike suits kids ages 2-4 years old (between 80 to 105cm tall)；\nThe 14-inch bike suits kids ages 3-6 years old (between 90 to 125cm tall)；\nThe 16-inch bike suits kids ages 4-7 years old (between 105 to 135cm tall)；\nThe 20-inch bike suits kids ages 7 years old and up (between 125 to 155cm tall).\n\nErgonomic Seat\n\nMake your child more comfortable and enjoy the ride.\n\nV-brake\n\nV-brake is lighter and easier to maintain and adjust.\n\nSingle Speed Drivetrain\n\nA simple and reliable set-up let kids easier to ride. Rear coaster brake provides dependable control as you need it, just pedal back to stop.\n\nWide Tires\n\nSturdy 1.95 wide tires protect kids against flats to keep them riding all day.\n\nEagle is a kid bike launched by Hiland with children's safety fully considered. With its unique frame design, bright and bold color matching and eagle decal pattern, this series of bike is stylish and sporty which can be noticed at a glance. It is easy to control and quick to master, helping to develop little hero's riding confidence. Start their adventure with Eagle kids bikes and experience the joy of riding to the fullest!",
